%S A401371 278638999,367794667,1043816933,1583990153,1884088421,2135672573,
%T A401371 2575138661,3613342643,4014956593,7260325951,9589294109,10780157263,
%U A401371 11666293273,15787553519,16620911761,16761810817,19777416047
%N A401371 Numbers of the form p^2*q*r where p, q, r are primes with p > q > r, such that A003415(p^2*q*r) divides A276085(p^2*q*r), where A276085 is fully additive with a(p) = p#/p, and A003415 is the arithmetic derivative.
%C A401371 The condition that p divides A276085(p^2*q*r) is a prerequisite for the terms of this sequence, thus this is a subsequence of A401231.
%C A401371 The 17 initial terms occur among the 1020 initial terms of A401231. Note the much lower percentage as when compared to A401230/A401229.
%H A401371 <a href="/index/Pri#primorial_numbers">Index entries for sequences related to primorial numbers</a>.
%Y A401371 Intersection of A373487 and A401231.
%Y A401371 Cf. A003415, A276085.
%Y A401371 Cf. also A401229, A401230.
%K A401371 nonn,more,new
%O A401371 1,1
